Source: https://github.com/IAPro-Community/nexus/tree/ab1efac2c80dddb7b3aa60016baf1d4791bc3203

- model/types.go: internal/core/model/types.go (subset: account scope, provider, usage, capabilities, failure).
- classifier/classifier.go and classifier_test.go: internal/core/classifier/* (import paths).
- quota/eligibility.go, eligibility_test.go, view.go, view_builder.go: internal/core/quota/* (import paths).
